WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Kneel with knees together and feet slightly wider than the hips, tops of the feet flat.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Sit down between the heels - onto a block if the hips do not reach the floor comfortably.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Root the sitting bones and lengthen the spine tall out of the pelvis.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Rest the palms on the thighs and soften the shoulders away from the ears.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Stay for slow, even breaths; come out by shifting to one side and extending the legs.
